	<message key="plugins.generic.reviewerCertificate.settings.logoImage">Logo</message>
	<message key="plugins.generic.reviewerCertificate.settings.logoImageDescription">Optional PNG or JPEG (max 5 MB), drawn over the background. A PNG with a transparent background works best. Width in mm keeps the image's proportions. Leave X and Y at -1 for the automatic position (top left).</message>
