	<message key="plugins.generic.reviewerCertificate.settings.coverImageDescription">Optional PNG or JPEG (max 5 MB), drawn over the background. Width in mm keeps the image's proportions. Leave X and Y at -1 for the automatic position (top right).</message>
	<message key="plugins.generic.reviewerCertificate.settings.sealImage">Seal</message>
	<message key="plugins.generic.reviewerCertificate.settings.sealImageDescription">Optional PNG or JPEG (max 5 MB), drawn over the background; use a PNG with a transparent background for a round seal. Width in mm keeps the image's proportions. Leave X and Y at -1 for the automatic position: bottom right, or just left of the QR code when the QR code is enabled.</message>
