	<message key="plugins.generic.reviewerCertificate.settings.typography.footerDescription">Style and position of the footer text. "Bottom left" or "Bottom centre" pins it at a fixed distance from the bottom edge of the page (for example inside a band in your background image); the rest of the content is kept above it.</message>
